cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tadah! in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Tadah!MLIP"
abstract: >-
  Tadah! is a multi-module C++/CMake framework for developing and
  deploying machine-learning interatomic potentials, including a
  LAMMPS plugin and a hyperparameter-optimisation driver.
